{"date":"04-24","anniversaryYear":2026,"nameDays":{"cz":{"country":"cz","label":"Česko","language":"cs","heading":"Svátek má","names":[{"name":"Jiří","note":null,"variantOf":null,"meaning":{"title":"Jiří","aboutName":"Jiří","extract":"Jiří je nejčastější české mužské jméno. K roku 2016 bylo jeho nositeli 296 090 Čechů. Za svou četnost vděčí zejména své velké popularitě od 40. do 80. let 20. století. Jedním z nejsilnějších se stal rok 1952, ve kterém si jméno Jiří odneslo z porodnice celkem 6 553 novorozenců, kteří jsou dosud naživu (stav k 31. prosinci 2013). Dnes již mezi novorozenci tak rozšířené není, do roku 2016 se pravidelně pohybovalo v první dvacítce.","url":"https://cs.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Ji%C5%99%C3%AD&oldid=26097204","source":{"title":"Jiří","wiki":"cs.wikipedia.org","revisionUrl":"https://cs.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Ji%C5%99%C3%AD&oldid=26097204","historyUrl":"https://cs.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Ji%C5%99%C3%AD&action=history","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/deed.cs","fetchedAt":"2026-10-29T14:57:02+00:00"}},"bearer":{"name":"Jiří Menzel","wikidataId":"Q352030","url":"https://cs.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ji%C5%99%C3%AD_Menzel"}}],"otherNames":[{"name":"Bojana","note":null},{"name":"Debora","note":null},{"name":"Egmont","note":null},{"name":"Fidel","note":null},{"name":"Fidelie","note":null},{"name":"Fidelius","note":null},{"name":"Gaston","note":null}],"source":{"title":"24. duben","wiki":"cs.wikipedia.org","revisionUrl":"https://cs.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=24._duben&oldid=26106375","historyUrl":"https://cs.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=24._duben&action=history","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/deed.cs","fetchedAt":"2026-10-29T02:46:36+00:00"}},"sk":{"country":"sk","label":"Slovensko","language":"sk","heading":"Meniny má","names":[{"name":"Juraj","note":null,"variantOf":null,"meaning":{"title":"Juraj (prvé meno)","aboutNam